{"id":"bc8c800bbf59f617","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-orientation.md","title":"Orientation","display":"df-orientation — Orientation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-orientation","aliases":["58-df-orientation","Orientation"],"display":"df-orientation — Orientation","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-orientation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-orientation</span><span>Orientation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-orientation — Orientation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md\">../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,n)\\)</span>（光滑顶次微分形式，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"db62358c2ba471b0\" href=\"?note=db62358c2ba471b0\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md\">../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orientable}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Orientable}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orientation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n) \\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\land\\exists\\eta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,n)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta(p))\\;(\\eta(p)(v)\\neq0)\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orientation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n) \\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\land\\exists\\eta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,n)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta(p))\\;(\\eta(p)(v)\\neq0)\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(B,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\varnothing\\neq B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in B\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n(\\|y-x\\|&lt;r\\to y\\in B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in B\\;(\\|x\\|&lt;R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(B,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\varnothing\\neq B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in B\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n(\\|y-x\\|&lt;r\\to y\\in B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in B\\;(\\|x\\|&lt;R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>定向等价于切空间定向的连续（在光滑情形为光滑）选择。</li>\n<li>对光滑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 维流形，可定向当且仅当存在处处非零的光滑顶次形式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(B,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(B,n)\\)</span> 固定使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 的标准定向，并把 Brouwer 次数所需的非空、开与有界条件展开；这补足了依赖该符号的次数原子此前缺失的来源定义。</li>\n<li>Orientation cover: double cover for non-orientable</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n, S^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n, S^n\\)</span> orientable; Klein bottle, Möbius strip non-orientable</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Guillemin and Pollack, Differential Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md","status":"resolved","id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega_{>0}$ 且 $\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)$（see [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md","status":"resolved","id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,n)$（光滑顶次微分形式，see [[../batch05/58-df-differential-form.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orientable}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orientation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n) \\leftrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\land\\exists\\eta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DifferentialKForm}_S(\\eta,M,n,n)\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta(p))\\;(\\eta(p)(v)\\neq0)\\bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}domain}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(B,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land\\varnothing\\neq B\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in B\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n(\\|y-x\\|<r\\to y\\in B)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall x\\in B\\;(\\|x\\|<R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(B,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n, S^n","display":false}],"bytes":2032,"backlinks":[{"id":"fb3df47c91e4a261","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orientable}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (smooth orientability predicate, including the smooth-manifold and nowhere-vanishing top-form data; see [[../batch02/58-df-orientation.md]])"},{"id":"11b61659960c0df8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OrientedBoundedDomain}_S(B,n)$ (oriented bounded-domain predicate, see [[58-df-orientation]])"},{"id":"c8c26f9dc2425e2f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Orientable}_S(M,n)$ (see [[58-df-orientation]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-925","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-orientation.md|58-df-orientation]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["71fe0dc4c8613e69","db62358c2ba471b0"]}